    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>≤</mo><mn>12</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;is the set of points in the interval <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> at which <math><mi>f</mi></math> is not differentiable, then <math><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;is"
