  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>12</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0018_680001981942.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.97361in;height:1.37986in\" /><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is not differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>"
